{"4159710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hearse Hero", "steam_appid": 4159710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hit Your Targets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Heinrich the Hearse Hero. Business has been slow, forcing you to take matters into your own hands. Strike down your victims with your Hearse but, be careful, you're on the clock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159710/extras/52167080199ef7705f79e9c0fcd28ba4.poster.avif?t=1786085165\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159710/extras/52167080199ef7705f79e9c0fcd28ba4.webm?t=1786085165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159710/extras/52167080199ef7705f79e9c0fcd28ba4.mp4?t=1786085165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bury Your Targets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry your coffins to their final destination by weaving between traffic, destructible scenery, police and pedestrians in a race against the clock. Burying your victims grants you additional time, allowing you to remain employed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159710/extras/2193e82d56ec9e776db27959b8fe2b84.poster.avif?t=1786085165\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159710/extras/2193e82d56ec9e776db27959b8fe2b84.webm?t=1786085165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159710/extras/2193e82d56ec9e776db27959b8fe2b84.mp4?t=1786085165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cause Property Damage</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let nothing stop you from carrying out your duty as you create carnage across 20 levels. From snowy peaks and leafy suburbs to the depths of Bradford, nothing can stop the Hearse Hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159710/extras/ef4ce084fc2e4eeebb159e0e4b7ffd6c.poster.avif?t=1786085165\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159710/extras/ef4ce084fc2e4eeebb159e0e4b7ffd6c.webm?t=1786085165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159710/extras/ef4ce084fc2e4eeebb159e0e4b7ffd6c.mp4?t=1786085165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full Level Editor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing campaign levels unlocks them for manipulation in the full level editor. Scenery, obstacles, targets, traffic and trees can all be tailored to meet your targets. Alternatively, start your own level from scratch and make the perfect challenge for the Hearse Hero. Levels can be shared through the Steam Workshop, with a handy voting system allowing the cream to rise to the top. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159710/extras/a60f0e88937bad4015cce39a2b5be330.poster.avif?t=1786085165\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159710/extras/a60f0e88937bad4015cce39a2b5be330.webm?t=1786085165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159710/extras/a60f0e88937bad4015cce39a2b5be330.mp4?t=1786085165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Day or Night, Rain or Shine</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the 20 levels has been handcrafted by a solo developer using the Open Source Godot Game Engine. Anything not created in-house has been purchased from REAL artists or obtained from other Open Source projects. No procedural generation or AI assets here! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159710/extras/2e0e40671528185838dc04e07c7e3407.poster.avif?t=1786085165\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159710/extras/2e0e40671528185838dc04e07c7e3407.webm?t=1786085165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159710/extras/2e0e40671528185838dc04e07c7e3407.mp4?t=1786085165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hit Your Targets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Heinrich the Hearse Hero. Business has been slow, forcing you to take matters into your own hands. Strike down your victims with your Hearse but, be careful, you're on the clock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159710/extras/52167080199ef7705f79e9c0fcd28ba4.poster.avif?t=1786085165\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159710/extras/52167080199ef7705f79e9c0fcd28ba4.webm?t=1786085165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159710/extras/52167080199ef7705f79e9c0fcd28ba4.mp4?t=1786085165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bury Your Targets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry your coffins to their final destination by weaving between traffic, destructible scenery, police and pedestrians in a race against the clock. Burying your victims grants you additional time, allowing you to remain employed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159710/extras/2193e82d56ec9e776db27959b8fe2b84.poster.avif?t=1786085165\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159710/extras/2193e82d56ec9e776db27959b8fe2b84.webm?t=1786085165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159710/extras/2193e82d56ec9e776db27959b8fe2b84.mp4?t=1786085165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cause Property Damage</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let nothing stop you from carrying out your duty as you create carnage across 20 levels. From snowy peaks and leafy suburbs to the depths of Bradford, nothing can stop the Hearse Hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159710/extras/ef4ce084fc2e4eeebb159e0e4b7ffd6c.poster.avif?t=1786085165\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159710/extras/ef4ce084fc2e4eeebb159e0e4b7ffd6c.webm?t=1786085165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159710/extras/ef4ce084fc2e4eeebb159e0e4b7ffd6c.mp4?t=1786085165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full Level Editor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing campaign levels unlocks them for manipulation in the full level editor. Scenery, obstacles, targets, traffic and trees can all be tailored to meet your targets. Alternatively, start your own level from scratch and make the perfect challenge for the Hearse Hero. Levels can be shared through the Steam Workshop, with a handy voting system allowing the cream to rise to the top. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159710/extras/a60f0e88937bad4015cce39a2b5be330.poster.avif?t=1786085165\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159710/extras/a60f0e88937bad4015cce39a2b5be330.webm?t=1786085165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159710/extras/a60f0e88937bad4015cce39a2b5be330.mp4?t=1786085165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Day or Night, Rain or Shine</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the 20 levels has been handcrafted by a solo developer using the Open Source Godot Game Engine. Anything not created in-house has been purchased from REAL artists or obtained from other Open Source projects. No procedural generation or AI assets here! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159710/extras/2e0e40671528185838dc04e07c7e3407.poster.avif?t=1786085165\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159710/extras/2e0e40671528185838dc04e07c7e3407.webm?t=1786085165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159710/extras/2e0e40671528185838dc04e07c7e3407.mp4?t=1786085165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Inspired by classics such as Crazy Taxi and Simpsons Road Rage. You are Heinrich, the enigmatic Hearse Hero. Hit your targets and hurtle them to the hereafter while dodging police, pedestrians and more. 20 action-packed levels, plus a custom map editor with Steam Workshop support.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159710/d90d22519b803a33f4c1f7a2f7330e17db84e490/header.jpg?t=1786085165", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159710/51abbcf3f833543d9081e88e0e094ac3acc03712/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786085165", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4159710/51abbcf3f833543d9081e88e0e094ac3acc03712/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786085165", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or greater (64 bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86_64 CPU with SSE4.2 support<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics with full Vulkan 1.0 support or Direct3D 12 (12_0 feature level) support (Windows) e.g. Intel HD Graphics 510 (Skylake), AMD Radeon R5 Graphics (Kaveri)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Made using the Godot Game Engine</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or greater (64 bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86_64 CPU with SSE4.2 support, with 4 physical cores or more<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated graphics with full Vulkan 1.2 support or Direct3D 12 